# 8. Jobs to Be Done

### Discovery

> When something happens in the world, help me immediately find every market where I can trade it.

### Comparison

> When multiple venues offer the same market, tell me which one gives me the best executable price.

### Divergence

> Tell me when Kalshi and Polymarket materially disagree about the probability of the same outcome.

### Arbitrage

> Tell me when complementary positions across venues can be purchased for less than their guaranteed settlement value.

### Monitoring

> Let me follow an event without repeatedly checking both platforms.

### Trust

> Before I trade a price discrepancy, help me verify that the two contracts actually resolve according to equivalent rules.

