# 46. MVP Definition of Done

The MVP is ready for external beta when a user can open the Mac app, search for a real-world prediction, see equivalent contracts from Kalshi and Polymarket combined into a single canonical market, compare current executable prices and liquidity, understand material differences between resolution rules, watch that market, receive an alert when the venues diverge, and navigate directly to the appropriate exchange to trade.

The defining experience should feel like:

> **“I no longer need to check Kalshi and Polymarket separately.”**